<title>USA: MAF Bancorp changes fiscal year end.</title>
<headline>MAF Bancorp changes fiscal year end.</headline>
<dateline>CLARENDON HILLS, Ill. 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>MAF Bancorp Inc said Thursday its board of directors approved a change in the fiscal year-end to December 31 from June 30.</p>
<p>The change becomes effective for the period ending December 31, 1996.</p>
<p>The company said it intends to file a form 10-K with the Securities and Exchange Commission for the six-month transition period ending on December 31.</p>
<p>MAF Bancorp is the parent company of Mid America Federal Savings Bank, a federally chartered stock savings bank.</p>
<p>Reuters Chicago Newsdesk - 312-408-8787</p>
